# Resources API Endpoints

Complete reference for Resources API endpoints.

---

## Overview

The Resources API provides content management for articles, disclosures, news, and actions. It uses a standardized response format.

**Base URL:** `/api/v1/resources/`

**Authentication:** JWT Bearer token required for write operations

---

## Response Format

### Success Response (List)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Resources retrieved successfully",
  "data": [...],
  "meta": {
    "current_page": 1,
    "per_page": 10,
    "total": 50,
    "total_pages": 5
  }
}
```

### Success Response (Single)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Resource retrieved successfully",
  "data": { ... }
}
```

### Error Response

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Validation failed",
  "errors": {
    "field_name": ["Error message"]
  }
}
```

---

## Endpoints

### List Resources

Get a paginated list of resources with filtering and search.

```bash
GET /api/v1/resources/?category=article&status=published&featured=true&search=keyword&page=1&per_page=10
```

**Query Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Description |
|-----------|------|-------------|
| `category` | string | Filter by category: `article`, `disclosure`, `news`, `actions` |
| `status` | string | Filter by status: `draft`, `pending`, `approved`, `published`, `archived` |
| `featured` | boolean | Filter by featured status: `true`, `false` |
| `search` | string | Full-text search in title and content |
| `page` | integer | Page number (default: 1) |
| `per_page` | integer | Items per page (default: 10, max: 100) |
| `sort` | string | Sort field (default: `-date`) |

**Success Response (200 OK):**

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Resources retrieved successfully",
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "slug": "sample-article",
      "title": "Sample Article",
      "content": "<p>Article content...</p>",
      "excerpt": "Brief description",
      "category": "article",
      "tags": ["finance", "investment"],
      "status": "published",
      "featured": true,
      "meta_title": "Sample Article - NM Dividends",
      "meta_description": "Learn about investments",
      "og_image": "/media/og-image.jpg",
      "author_name": "John Doe",
      "author_user": 1,
      "date": "2026-04-01T10:00:00Z",
      "created_at": "2026-03-30T08:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-04-01T12:00:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "current_page": 1,
    "per_page": 10,
    "total": 50,
    "total_pages": 5
  }
}
```

**Error Response (400 Bad Request):**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Invalid query parameters",
  "errors": {
    "category": ["Invalid category choice."]
  }
}
```

### Get Single Resource

Get a single resource by slug.

```bash
GET /api/v1/resources/sample-article/
```

**Success Response (200 OK):**

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Resource retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "slug": "sample-article",
    "title": "Sample Article",
    "content": "<p>Full article content...</p>",
    "excerpt": "Brief description",
    "category": "article",
    "tags": ["finance", "investment"],
    "status": "published",
    "featured": true,
    "meta_title": "Sample Article - NM Dividends",
    "meta_description": "Learn about investments",
    "og_image": "/media/og-image.jpg",
    "author_name": "John Doe",
    "author_user": 1,
    "date": "2026-04-01T10:00:00Z",
    "link": "https://example.com/external",
    "created_at": "2026-03-30T08:00:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-01T12:00:00Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response (404 Not Found):**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Resource not found.",
  "data": null
}
```

### Create Resource

Create a new resource. Requires admin or editor role.

```bash
POST /api/v1/resources/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New Article",
  "content": "<p>Article content here...</p>",
  "excerpt": "Brief description of the article",
  "category": "article",
  "tags": ["finance", "news"],
  "status": "draft",
  "featured": false,
  "meta_title": "New Article",
  "meta_description": "Description for SEO",
  "og_image": "/media/og-image.jpg",
  "date": "2026-04-02T10:00:00Z",
  "link": "https://example.com"
}
```

**Success Response (201 Created):**

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Resource created successfully",
  "data": {
    "id": 2,
    "slug": "new-article",
    "title": "New Article",
    "content": "<p>Article content here...</p>",
    "excerpt": "Brief description of the article",
    "category": "article",
    "tags": ["finance", "news"],
    "status": "draft",
    "featured": false,
    "meta_title": "New Article",
    "meta_description": "Description for SEO",
    "og_image": "/media/og-image.jpg",
    "author_name": "John Doe",
    "author_user": 1,
    "date": "2026-04-02T10:00:00Z",
    "link": "https://example.com",
    "created_at": "2026-04-02T10:00:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-02T10:00:00Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response (400 Bad Request) - Validation:**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Validation failed",
  "errors": {
    "title": ["This field is required."],
    "category": ["Invalid category choice."],
    "tags": ["List contains 11 items, it should contain no more than 10."]
  }
}
```

**Error Response (401 Unauthorized):**

```json
{
  "detail": "Authentication credentials were not provided."
}
```

**Error Response (403 Forbidden):**

```json
{
  "detail": "You do not have permission to perform this action."
}
```

### Update Resource

Update an existing resource. Requires admin or editor role.

```bash
PUT /api/v1/resources/new-article/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Article Title",
  "content": "<p>Updated content...</p>",
  "status": "published",
  "featured": true
}
```

Or partial update:

```bash
PATCH /api/v1/resources/new-article/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "published",
  "featured": true
}
```

**Success Response (200 OK):**

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Resource updated successfully",
  "data": {
    "id": 2,
    "slug": "new-article",
    "title": "Updated Article Title",
    "content": "<p>Updated content...</p>",
    "category": "article",
    "status": "published",
    "featured": true,
    "updated_at": "2026-04-02T11:00:00Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response (404 Not Found):**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Resource not found.",
  "data": null
}
```

### Delete Resource

Delete a resource. Requires admin role.

```bash
DELETE /api/v1/resources/new-article/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
```

**Success Response (204 No Content):**
*(Empty response body)*

**Error Response (403 Forbidden) - Not Admin:**

```json
{
  "detail": "You do not have permission to perform this action."
}
```

**Error Response (404 Not Found):**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Resource not found.",
  "data": null
}
```

### List Categories

Get all resource categories with counts.

```bash
GET /api/v1/resources/categories/
```

**Success Response (200 OK):**

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "article",
      "name": "Articles",
      "slug": "article",
      "description": "Standard articles and blog posts",
      "resource_count": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "disclosure",
      "name": "Disclosures",
      "slug": "disclosure",
      "description": "Corporate disclosures and announcements",
      "resource_count": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "news",
      "name": "News",
      "slug": "news",
      "description": "News items and updates",
      "resource_count": 75
    },
    {
      "id": "actions",
      "name": "Actions",
      "slug": "actions",
      "description": "Administrative actions and announcements",
      "resource_count": 10
    }
  ]
}
```

