## Media Endpoints

### Upload Media

Upload a media file. Requires admin or editor role.

```bash
POST /api/v1/resources/media/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

file: <binary-image-data>
type: featured  # optional: featured, attachment
```

**Success Response (201 Created):**

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Media uploaded successfully",
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "filename": "abc123def456.jpg",
    "original_name": "my-image.jpg",
    "url": "/media/uploads/featured/5/abc123def456.jpg",
    "size": 1024576,
    "mime_type": "image/jpeg",
    "type": "featured",
    "uploaded_at": "2026-04-02T10:00:00Z"
  }
}
```

**Error Response (400 Bad Request) - No File:**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "No file provided.",
  "errors": {
    "file": ["This field is required."]
  }
}
```

**Error Response (413 Payload Too Large):**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "File size exceeds 5MB limit.",
  "errors": {
    "file": ["Maximum file size is 5MB."]
  }
}
```

**Error Response (415 Unsupported Media Type):**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Invalid file type. Allowed: JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP.",
  "errors": {
    "file": ["Invalid file type."]
  }
}
```

### Delete Media

Delete a media file. Requires admin or editor role.

```bash
DELETE /api/v1/resources/media/1/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
```

**Success Response (204 No Content):**
*(Empty response body)*

**Error Response (404 Not Found):**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Media file not found.",
  "data": null
}
```

---

## Field Reference

### Categories

| Value | Display Name |
|-------|--------------|
| `article` | Article |
| `disclosure` | Disclosure |
| `news` | News |
| `actions` | Actions |

### Statuses

| Value | Display Name | Description |
|-------|--------------|-------------|
| `draft` | Draft | Initial creation, not visible |
| `pending` | Pending | Awaiting approval |
| `approved` | Approved | Approved but not published |
| `published` | Published | Publicly visible |
| `archived` | Archived | No longer active |

### Media Types

| Value | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `featured` | Featured image for resources |
| `attachment` | General attachment |

### Allowed Media Formats

- JPEG (.jpg, .jpeg)
- PNG (.png)
- GIF (.gif)
- WebP (.webp)

**Max file size:** 5MB

---

## Permission Matrix

| Action | Anonymous | Authenticated | Editor | Admin |
|--------|-----------|---------------|--------|-------|
| List resources | ✅ Published only | ✅ Published only | ✅ All | ✅ All |
| Get single resource | ✅ Published only | ✅ Published only | ✅ All | ✅ All |
| Create resource | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Update resource | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Delete resource | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Upload media | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Delete media | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |

---

## Examples

### Create Article with Tags

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/resources/ \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "title": "Understanding Dividends",
    "content": "<p>Dividends are payments...</p>",
    "excerpt": "A guide to understanding dividends",
    "category": "article",
    "tags": ["dividends", "investing", "stocks"],
    "status": "published",
    "featured": true
  }'
```

### Search Resources

```bash
curl "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/resources/?search=dividend&category=article&status=published"
```

### Filter by Category

```bash
curl "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/resources/?category=disclosure&sort=-date"
```

### Upload Featured Image

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/resources/media/ \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" \
  -F "file=@featured-image.jpg" \
  -F "type=featured"
```

